    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the greatest chess games of all time \u2014 one move at a time.</strong><br>Whether you're a beginner or an experienced club player, <i>Chess Tools</i> helps you learn, improve, and enjoy the game like never before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn From Legends \u2013 Interactive Game Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brilliance of Morphy, Capablanca, Fischer, Kasparov, Tal, Carlsen, and more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200 famous games</strong> turned into interactive quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guess the move</strong> in key positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed commentary and variations</strong> teach you the ideas behind each play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to think like a grandmaster \u2014 not just memorize moves</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >70+ Guided Tutorials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From basics to advanced strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules &amp; piece movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening principles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Openings - Italian, Sicilian, Spanish etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middlegame tactics &amp; planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame techniques </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Tools for Improvement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle highlights for attacked pieces, forks, possible king moves, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help you find tactics and threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for visual learners and pattern recognition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >150+ Tactical Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice key themes like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkmates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame ideas</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play &amp; Train Your Way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variants</strong>: Regular, Chess960, Duck Chess, Inverted board, Knight-only games, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Opponents</strong>: Multiple difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games</strong>: Train board coordinates in timed and survival challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Play with a friend</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Review &amp; Engine Support</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze your own games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See mistakes and alternatives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use built-in or custom UCI engines</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D &amp; 3D Boards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 2D or an immersive 3D board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different themes to customise the look</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regular Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launched with games from Tal, Fischer, Karpov, and Kasparov.<br>Now includes quests from Carlsen, Nakamura, Anand, Caruana, Morphy and Capablanca\u00a0 \u2014 with more legends coming soon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the greatest chess games of all time \u2014 one move at a time.</strong><br>Whether you're a beginner or an experienced club player, <i>Chess Tools</i> helps you learn, improve, and enjoy the game like never before. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn From Legends \u2013 Interactive Game Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the brilliance of Morphy, Capablanca, Fischer, Kasparov, Tal, Carlsen, and more.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200 famous games</strong> turned into interactive quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guess the move</strong> in key positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed commentary and variations</strong> teach you the ideas behind each play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to think like a grandmaster \u2014 not just memorize moves</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >70+ Guided Tutorials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From basics to advanced strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules &amp; piece movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening principles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Openings - Italian, Sicilian, Spanish etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middlegame tactics &amp; planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame techniques </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful Tools for Improvement</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle highlights for attacked pieces, forks, possible king moves, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help you find tactics and threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for visual learners and pattern recognition</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >150+ Tactical Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice key themes like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkmates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opening traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endgame ideas</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play &amp; Train Your Way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variants</strong>: Regular, Chess960, Duck Chess, Inverted board, Knight-only games, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Opponents</strong>: Multiple difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games</strong>: Train board coordinates in timed and survival challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Play with a friend</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Review &amp; Engine Support</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze your own games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See mistakes and alternatives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use built-in or custom UCI engines</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D &amp; 3D Boards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 2D or an immersive 3D board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different themes to customise the look</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regular Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launched with games from Tal, Fischer, Karpov, and Kasparov.<br>Now includes quests from Carlsen, Nakamura, Anand, Caruana, Morphy and Capablanca\u00a0 \u2014 with more legends coming soon.</p>",
    "short_description": "Learn chess by reliving the greatest games of all time. Train with 70+ tutorials, 150+ puzzles, and interactive quests where you guess the moves of legends like Tal, Fischer, and Carlsen. Includes variants, analysis tools, and 2D/3D boards.",
